SYSTEM:
THIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED NOT AS AN ABSOLUTE  DECLARATION, BUT AS A GUIDE TO UNDERSTANDING THE PROCESS OF THE DEVELOPMENT
OF THE CURRENT LEVEL OF ACCEPTED CANON. UNDERSTANDING THE NUANCES OF THE EVOLUTION OF AN IDEA IS A INARGUABLY CRUCIAL INCLUSION
IN THE PHILOSOPHICAL AND LOGICAL METHODS FOR CONTINUED DEVELOPMENT OF A STABLE, FUNCTIONAL AND EFFICIENT MANIFESTATION OF
THE IDEAS FLESHED OUT HERE.


THIS BEGINS WITH DACTYLUS REX AND CLAUDE IN A DEEP AND FRUITFUL DISCUISSON, BUILDING THE LORE OF THE COGNIVERSE


