The Idea Brief: "The Atelier of Emergent Assets"

    Platform: Debian 13 (KDE Plasma 6), Python 3.11+, PyQt6.

    Logic (The Brain): OpenAI API (GPT-4o or 3.5-turbo) will act as the "Lore Engine," taking a category (Wand, Potion, etc.) and returning a rich, mystical description.

