        Control Panel: Sliders/inputs for SD settings (Steps, CFG, Seed) and your OpenAI API Key.

        The Vault: A "Keep" button that moves the current generation (Image + Text) into a permanent /vault directory with a unique timestamped filename.

To ensure the Lore is deeply ingrained and the Logic is industrial-grade, we are going to implement a Metadata-JSON Sidecar system.

This is the "Secret Sauce" of the Arca Cognitorium. When you save an asset to the Vault, it won't just be a picture; it will be a "Digital Relic" containing the seed, the specific GPT-generated lore, and the timestamp. This allows the main project to "read" these files later and know exactly what a wand is made of without re-running the AI.
1. Deepening the Lore: The "Assessor" System Prompt

To make the categories feel "Luminarious," we will refine the OpenAI logic. Instead of just asking for a description, we will feed the "Taxonomy of the Tower" into the hidden instructions.

