    The Conservatory: Mystical Plants, Fungi, Essences.

    The Printing House: Broadsheets, Formal Declarations, Sigils.

3. The "Solid" Logic: JSON Sidecars & Error Handling

We will add a RelicManager class. When you click "Keep," it does three things:

    Saves asset_TIMESTAMP.png.

    Saves asset_TIMESTAMP.json (containing the Lore text, Seed, CFG Scale, and Category).

    Moves the "Temporary" file to a permanent /vault/relics folder.


