    The Sigillarium: Focused on Sigils, Glyphs, and Seals—abstract, high-contrast visual markers used for binding.

    The Reliquary: For Legendary & Ancient Artifacts—these should feel older, more ornate, and "heavier" in their history.

    The Printing House: For Broadsheets, Proclamations, and Type-set lore—focused on the intersection of arcane knowledge and the printed word.

    The Workshop of Unfinished Things: A "junk drawer" of Broken or Partial items—great for generating base materials or "residuum" that hasn't found its form yet.

    The Celestial Observatorium: For Astral Tools and Star-maps—items made of glass, light, and celestial alignment.


